              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बंद पडणे — band paḍṇe — \"to stop working; to break down\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घाटात आमची बस बंद पडली. ghāṭāt āmcī bas band paḍlī. Our bus broke down on the ghat road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो बंद पडला, to band paḍlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Machines, clocks and lifts बंद पडतात; बंद करणे is to switch off."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बंद पडणे (band paḍṇe) joins बंद, \"closed\", a loan usually traced to Persian band, to पडणे, \"to fall\": to fall still."
            }
          ]
